  "summary": "The Back-Alley Mage’s Return Manhwa Aster, a troublemaker from the Dequlan family of magicians, who used to be a vagrant. He runs away for freedom, but is eventually caught and loses his life. But when he opens his eyes, he finds himself back in his vagrant days in the black-and-white zone…! “I will build the library that was my comrades’ dream, no, I will build a tower even greater than that!” “As a bonus, I will display the Deculanga Vision Book on the first floor.” Aster’s return to life as a vagabond! 뒷골목 마법사의 회귀생활, Return of the Back Alley Wizard",
